[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441940383","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4182#issuecomment-441940383","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4182","id":441940383,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0MTk0MDM4Mw==","user":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-02-06T20:38:30Z","updated_at":"2018-11-27T06:17:36Z","body":"**Michael Bayer ([@zzzeek](https://github.com/zzzeek)) wrote:**\n\nI can reproduce this. however cursor.close() is not raising and the stack traces above don't show this. the issue is that cx_Oracle is raising this as a cx_Oracle.DatabaseError where our cx_oracle.is_disconnect() logic does not expect a DatabaseError to have a code associated with it.   this is likely due to the rewrite of cx_Oracle in version 6.   Please confirm the patch resolves on your end:\n\n\n```\ndiff --git a/lib/sqlalchemy/dialects/oracle/cx_oracle.py b/lib/sqlalchemy/dialects/oracle/cx_oracle.py\nindex 24655ee1b..b9d2ac8f6 100644\n--- a/lib/sqlalchemy/dialects/oracle/cx_oracle.py\n+++ b/lib/sqlalchemy/dialects/oracle/cx_oracle.py\n@@ -817,9 +817,12 @@ class OracleDialect_cx_oracle(OracleDialect):\n \n     def is_disconnect(self, e, connection, cursor):\n         error, = e.args\n-        if isinstance(e, (\n-                self.dbapi.InterfaceError, self.dbapi.DatabaseError)):\n-            return \"not connected\" in str(e)\n+        if isinstance(\n+                e,\n+                (self.dbapi.InterfaceError, self.dbapi.DatabaseError)\n+        ) and \"not connected\" in str(e):\n+            return True\n+\n         elif hasattr(error, 'code'):\n             # ORA-00028: your session has been killed\n             # ORA-03114: not connected to ORACLE\n\n```\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441940383/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-b