ile \"/home/mshantz/.virtualenvs/tmp-31dc1d1be1d35afd/lib/python3.5/site-packages/sqlalchemy/pool.py\", line 818, in _checkout\n    raise exc.InvalidatePoolError()\nsqlalchemy.exc.InvalidatePoolError: ()\n\nDuring handling of the above exception, another exception occurred:\n\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/mshantz/.virtualenvs/tmp-31dc1d1be1d35afd/lib/python3.5/site-packages/sqlalchemy/pool.py\", line 317, in _close_connection\n    self._dialect.do_close(connection)\n  File \"/home/mshantz/.virtualenvs/tmp-31dc1d1be1d35afd/lib/python3.5/site-packages/sqlalchemy/engine/default.py\", line 463, in do_close\n    dbapi_connection.close()\ncx_Oracle.OperationalError: ORA-03114: not connected to ORACLE\n[('X',)]\n\n```\n\nI'm not quite sure what happened there. I looks like the exception was raised but it still made it to my print statement?\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441940389/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s